By sending your (Soul Core) to the Trash, stack this from the Hand onto your target Spirit.

[LV1][LV2] (When Advents/Attacks)
Return an opposing Spirit/Ultimate to the deckbottom. For each pre-advent card beneath this Spirit, this effect returns +1 Spirit/Ultimate to the deck.

During OC [LV1][LV2] {{uha|Purple/White/Blue}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing Purple/White/Blue effects.

{{Burst|After the opposing Hand increases via an opposing effect}}
Summon this card without paying the cost. Then, ignoring the cost of Braves, return every opposing Cost 6 or less Spirit to the deckbottom. After this effect resolves, if the opponent controls any Spirit/Ultimate, and you control any "Orb" family Nexus, return an opposing Spirit/Ultimate and an opposing Nexus to the deckbottom.

[LV1][LV2][LV3] {{VPSa|Cost 7 or less}}
This Spirit is unaffected by opposing originally Cost 7 or less effects.

[LV2][LV3] (When Attacks)
Either return two opposing Spirits to the deckbottom, or exhaust them.

Including when this Nexus is deployed, cores can't be put onto, or moved from this Nexus, besides via your "Geats" Contract Spirit's effect, including those that are in Soul State/pre-advent condition. Also, this Nexus is unaffected by opposing effects.

[LV1] (Your Attack Step)
When the number of cores on this Nexus increases:
When it becomes 1/2/3/4, you can draw a card;
When it becomes 3/4/5, you can destroy an opposing Spirit/Ultimate;
When it becomes 4/6, you can put two cores from the Void to any of your Spirits;
When it becomes 7, you win the game.
